stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> Draft
 Draft --> Validated: checks pass
 Draft --> Invalid: checks fail
 Invalid --> Draft: correction
 Validated --> InReview
 InReview --> Approved: exact hash approved
 InReview --> Draft: requested changes
 Approved --> Published: authorized atomic activation
 Approved --> Scheduled
 Scheduled --> Published: effective time + recheck
 Published --> Retired: new starts stopped
 Retired --> [*]
